# Vision — Crypto & Stock Monitoring System

## Project Structure

```
Vision/
├── .cursor/          # Cursor config (MCP, rules)
├── scripts/          # Pipeline scripts (PDF extraction, chunking, indexing)
├── docs/
│   ├── raw/          # Extracted markdown from PDFs
│   ├── knowledge/    # Cleaned/structured markdown (manually reviewed)
│   └── chunks/       # Chunked JSON for indexing
├── vector_store/     # ChromaDB persistent storage
├── mcp_server/       # MCP server for knowledge base access
└── src/              # Vision application source code (to be built)
```

## Key Abbreviations

- **RVOL** — Relative Volume
- **OBI** — Order Book Imbalance
- **CVD** — Cumulative Volume Delta
- **VWAP** — Volume Weighted Average Price
- **SOS** — Sign of Strength (Wyckoff)
- **LPS** — Last Point of Support (Wyckoff)
- **PS** — Preliminary Support (Wyckoff)
- **SC** — Selling Climax (Wyckoff)
- **AR** — Automatic Rally (Wyckoff)
- **ST** — Secondary Test (Wyckoff)

## Principles

1. Every metric implementation must be grounded in theory from the knowledge base.
2. Search the knowledge base before writing new code for any trading concept.
3. Code must be well-typed and testable.
